WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.310
- I heard that you have a
collector's item at home.

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.930
Okay, Super Bowl winning quarterback

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.160
Patrick Mahomes.
(Henry gasps)

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.840
Yes, signed a jersey for you.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.710
- He did.
- Yeah.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:08.713
I was at that Super Bowl.

00:00:08.713 --> 00:00:12.150
- I just talked about
him on Rich Eisen's show.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:12.983
- Yeah.

00:00:12.983 --> 00:00:15.510
- And so then I said to
him, I said, you know,

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.670
if he ever comes to my house.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.760
- He would get like a
chicken stuffed with ricotta

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.971
and spinach with a reduction sauce.

00:00:22.971 --> 00:00:24.030
- (gasps) What?

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:27.540
- And then he, Rich Eisen,
played that for Mr. Mahomes.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.373
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:28.373 --> 00:00:30.930
- And I was invited to a
game here at SoFi Stadium,

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.200
I walked down on the field,
he comes running up to me,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.660
this is a very big person.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.270
- [Henry] This is about
6 or 7 people in one.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.103
(audience laughs)

00:00:40.103 --> 00:00:40.936
And here's the thing,

00:00:40.936 --> 00:00:42.480
you know when you hug somebody,

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.420
and your finger, you push in
and there's a little give?

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.253
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:46.253 --> 00:00:47.086
- No give.

00:00:47.086 --> 00:00:48.900
- Yeah, so like my body?
- It's like a can.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.580
- Yeah.
- It's like a can of soup.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.350
- [Kelly] It's hard.
- Yeah, hard.

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.420
And he said, "I've got
a surprise for you."

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.980
And he gave me his jersey.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.210
- That's so cool.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:58.043
- Okay.
(audience clapping)

00:00:58.043 --> 00:00:58.876
- I love that.

00:00:58.876 --> 00:00:59.709
(Henry stutters)

00:00:59.709 --> 00:01:01.170
Did you have the dinner?
- Huh?

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.495
- Did you invite him to dinner?

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:03.450
- Okay, so this is the thing,

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.070
So, now he runs off...

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:07.620
Now he's gonna play a big game,

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:11.460
hitting and running and throwing
and hurting and you know.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.870
- All the things.
- All the things.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:13.703
- Yeah.

00:01:13.703 --> 00:01:15.210
- And just before, as he runs off,

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:16.371
He turns around he goes,

00:01:16.371 --> 00:01:18.371
"I'm gonna take you up on that dinner."

00:01:18.371 --> 00:01:19.204
- [audience member] Woo.

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:20.122
- And he's gone.

00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:20.970
(audience clapping)

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.050
- When?

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:23.010
- Okay well.

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:24.090
- I'd like to know when.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:25.620
- He had to win a Super Bowl first.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:26.637
- He did.
- Yeah.

